{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：11:07 2026-10-29 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:07 2026-10-29 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:07 2026-10-29 HKT</p><p>香港仔發生工業意外。今日（29日）早上10時16分，石排灣道100A號香港仔漁業及海事分署一吊臂車進行外牆維修工作，懷疑收起吊臂工作台期間不穩，導致兩名男女工人失重心，跌出離地6米高的工作台，撼頭受傷。據報其中男工人暈倒，女工人則後腦受傷。</p><p>救援人員趕到，發現62歲姓歐男工陷入半昏迷，而57歲盧女工則清醒，遂將2人送往瑪麗醫院救治。現場消息稱，兩名工人當時繫有安全帶，他們跌出吊臂工作台並沒有墮地，但懸掛在半空撞向吊臂及工作台周邊，導致受傷。警方正調查事件。</p><img alt=\"兩名工人在吊臂工作台跌出，受傷送院。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/742cd78baff3b8e26fa4fd3749f8fb0b/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_11_58_09_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/76b503b3719037ef68620efb7fc4e912/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_11_58_08.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"涉事的吊臂工作台。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/05c65b67b295f8b3a69b74c539d4fd81/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_11_58_08_1__0.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員向在場工友調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/84805c80ebf1838af65d0a44612ec561/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_11_58_03.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"工友向警員講述事件。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1b8031f3516531eb2e6d55369c5ac565/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_11_58_05_3_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/da7225b18a0531f1d506beee2ca654c5/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_11_58_05_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9c043a12702456294842d335dada3a5b/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_11_58_05.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"地面遺下血迹。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/71c2dd70cfe375ee73b4f10a6bd617e9/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_11_58_04_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/582c6355d40ec892777a3f1c6fd07382/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_11_58_04.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/537a1927215f4498e3a573cc080b5a3a/2026-10/1_4_10.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d2cf7bd7915aa46bccd868324d3547a9/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_11_58_09_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/983dbba0c207ab54aebde02d424bbbb6/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_11_58_08_3_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6e29eab9fb957156684ef515c3511e1c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_11_58_08_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e85b15c97d63f6cd8bc3bc01c98ed230/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_11_58_07.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T05:21:15.953337+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":313,"images":14,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T03:07:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T05:18:43.460186+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T05:18:43.460186+00:00","content_hash":"3b2c59145d497a689a97cf1141c0287211e63b5bd5f2413dc605d346329c860c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}